# M-001 — Semantic Kernel Alpha

**Status:** Planned  
**Target gate:** 2026-09-13 (forecast)  
**Increment:** PI-001

## Outcome

A local Monad alpha can discover supported repository knowledge, assign stable identities, parse/resolve it, construct a provenance-rich semantic graph, lower a canonical KIR baseline, and emit stable diagnostics.

## Acceptance

- WC-0001 through WC-0004 accepted;
- graph/KIR/diagnostic conformance fixtures pass;
- deterministic repeated compilation passes;
- no open blocker prevents query/explain/context work;
- architecture/specification review approves continuation.

